.TH HD-ART 7 "October 2026" "hd-art" "HyprDebian"
.SH NAME
hd-art \- the hyprdebian wallpapers
.SH DESCRIPTION
The package
.B hd-art
holds the wallpapers of hyprdebian: the Emerald wallpaper of Debian 12,
rendered to PNG at four sizes.
It only installs the wallpapers; it has no commands and no settings.
.PP
The wallpapers are in
.IR /usr/share/backgrounds/hyprdebian :
.PP
.RS
.nf
emerald\-3840x2160.png    4K UHD, 16:9
emerald\-3440x1440.png    ultrawide, 21:9
emerald\-1920x1080.png    full HD, 16:9
emerald\-1024x768.png     4:3
.fi
.RE
.PP
The 3440x1440 wallpaper is rendered from the middle band of the 3840x2160
SVG.
.SH USING THE WALLPAPERS
Pick the wallpaper that matches the resolution of the monitor, or the next
larger one.
To show it on the desktop with
.BR hyprpaper (1),
name it in
.IR ~/.config/hypr/hyprpaper.conf :
.PP
.RS
.nf
path = /usr/share/backgrounds/hyprdebian/emerald\-1920x1080.png
.fi
.RE
.SH COPYRIGHT
The wallpapers are PNG renders of the Emerald theme SVGs from the Debian
package
.BR desktop-base ,
by Juliette Taka Belin, under the GPL, version 2 or later.
See
.IR /usr/share/doc/hd-art/copyright .
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/share/backgrounds/hyprdebian/emerald\-*.png
The wallpapers.
.TP
.I /usr/share/doc/hd-art/copyright
The copyright and license of the wallpapers.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR hyprpaper (1)
